  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: unhandled NotImplementedError denial-of-service in the\n     html.parser module when parsing malformed markup declarations\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-69534.patch: narrow the marked-section dispatch\n       in parse_html_declaration() in Lib/html/parser.py so only \"<![CDATA[\"\n       is routed to parse_marked_section(); any other malformed \"<!...\"\n       construct now falls through to parse_bogus_comment() instead of\n       reaching ParserBase.error(), which raises NotImplementedError.\n     - CVE-2025-69534",
